{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bash, mix and cook up all sorts of remedies to fix an ever increasing number of wounded monsters. Make use of every piece of equipment you can get your hands on to patch them up and send them on their way as quickly as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unusual Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a multitude of impatient monsters as they turn up at your shop looking for repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435640/extras/0b89c1d598b8a009ce02eba49a0d806f.avif?t=1770117965\" width=900 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fit out your shop with all manner of helpful appliances to help you heal the various ailments these monsters possess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435640/extras/e109cbfb928c842a6fccd56640f19522.avif?t=1770117965\" width=900 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go it alone or team up with your fellow quacks in local and online multiplayer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435640/extras/72766ec863b3e24de78e6c3de48f5b92.avif?t=1770117965\" width=900 height=400 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Risk and Reward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on optional challenges for greater rewards, if you think you can handle them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435640/extras/6c8dcc03ad5f3f75ff7fd8eeb597bc3f.avif?t=1770117965\" width=900 height=400 /></span></p>","b